{"id":"n69016-1-7","stage":5,"title":"우후죽순 · 雨后春笋","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n69016-1-7-1","ko":"우와, 여기 언제 이렇게 카페가 많아졌어?","zh":"哇，这里什么时候咖啡馆变这么多啦？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우와,","meaning":"哇","explanation":"우와：哇","readings":[{"term":"우와","audio":"/audio/2d727fbbe4b971d2bc9b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:우와:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"우와","origin":"course-authored supplement"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우와","audio":"/audio/2d727fbbe4b971d2bc9b.mp3"}},{"text":"여기","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}},{"text":"언제","meaning":"哪天，哪会儿","explanation":"언제：哪天，哪会儿","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17856","senseId":"2","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이렇게","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3"}},{"text":"카페가","meaning":"咖啡店，咖啡馆","explanation":"카페：咖啡店，咖啡馆；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"카페","audio":"/audio/53cc9fb21b3694bf4cb3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72162","senseId":"1","lemma":"카페","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"카페가","audio":"/audio/1c78d20c1d8c004dfd4c.mp3"}},{"text":"많아졌어?","meaning":"多，丰富，强；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많아졌어","audio":"/audio/7f3f29bff04665d64f94.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2d727fbbe4b971d2","term":"우와","zh":"哇","audio":"/audio/2d727fbbe4b971d2bc9b.mp3","definition":"惊讶、赞叹时的感叹。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"25f9ca42793d0a69","term":"언제","zh":"哪天，哪会儿","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3","entryId":"17856","definition":"在不明确指定的未来某个时间。","pronunciation":["언ː제"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"53cc9fb21b3694bf","term":"카페","zh":"咖啡店，咖啡馆","audio":"/audio/53cc9fb21b3694bf4cb3.mp3","entryId":"72162","definition":"主要销售咖啡、茶、点心等的店铺。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7d3506291a145611d7db.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n69016-1-7-2","ko":"예전엔 한 곳밖에 없었는데 갑자기 우후죽순으로 늘어났어.","zh":"以前只有一家而已，突然间像雨后春笋一样增多了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"예전엔","meaning":"很久以前","explanation":"예전：很久以前；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"예전","audio":"/audio/75497dc0562cdf68c50d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70090","senseId":"1","lemma":"예전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"예전엔","audio":"/audio/08214d8d3f374e614655.mp3"}},{"text":"한","meaning":"一","explanation":"한：一","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"1","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}},{"text":"곳밖에","meaning":"处，个","explanation":"곳：处，个；밖에：与否定表达合用，表示“只有、除……之外没有”。","readings":[{"term":"곳","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18661","senseId":"3","lemma":"곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"곳밖에","audio":"/audio/a67aa20cf1c501e647d4.mp3"}},{"text":"없었는데","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"1","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없었는데","audio":"/audio/530baabc563fc29e1ae9.mp3"}},{"text":"갑자기","meaning":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","explanation":"갑자기：突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","readings":[{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26797","senseId":"1","lemma":"갑자기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}},{"text":"우후죽순으로","meaning":"雨后春笋","explanation":"우후죽순：雨后春笋；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"우후죽순","audio":"/audio/68173e4476652010bf18.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69016","senseId":"1","lemma":"우후죽순","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우후죽순으로","audio":"/audio/b56f8f7ea8f83d099433.mp3"}},{"text":"늘어났어.","meaning":"增，涨，扩大","explanation":"늘어나다：增，涨，扩大；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"늘어나다","audio":"/audio/ba47d0c0fad388914dca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62833","senseId":"1","lemma":"늘어나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"늘어났어","audio":"/audio/83348aa85fe5671a8fb7.mp3"}}],"word